cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "seethrough-pythonx: See-Through layer decomposition driven from Elixir"
abstract: >-
  Elixir wrapper around the See-Through single-image layer decomposition
  pipeline. Embeds CPython via pythonx and calls the reference PyTorch
  implementation in-process, shipping as a single executable via burrito.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
